  "releaseNotes": "# Release Notes - Version X.X.X\n\n## 🎉 What's New\n\n### Major Features\n- **State/Status Management**: Select and apply state/status codes to merged-from records\n- **CRM Link Navigation**: Click SourceId/TargetId to open both records in CRM\n- **Enhanced Error Reporting**: Detailed error reports with separate validation and merge error sheets\n- **Improved Progress Tracking**: Real-time detailed progress updates with stage and relationship information\n\n### User Experience Improvements\n- Step-by-step guide labels throughout the UI\n- Scrollable, selectable validation grid\n- Excel file safety prompts\n- Process block warnings\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed duplicate link opening\n- Fixed UI overlapping issues\n- Fixed status picklist updates\n- Fixed null reference errors\n\n---\n\n**Download**: Update your tool in XrmToolBox",
